WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Every evening the sky over the harbour turned the colour of toast.

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Nobody knew who was spreading the marmalade.

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
"It's the lighthouse keeper," said the baker. "It always is."

4
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
The lighthouse keeper had never eaten breakfast in his life.

5
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.000
So the town did what towns do. They waited for sunset.

6
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.000
And this time, somebody was watching.
